---
// The colour key: what each colour means in the notes.
---
<ul class="cd-legend" aria-label="Colour key">
	<li><span class="cd-value">value</span> you choose</li>
	<li><code class="cd-code-word">CODE</code> type as is</li>
	<li><span class="cd-concept">concept</span> an idea</li>
	<li><span class="cd-keyword">keyword</span> built in</li>
</ul>
<style>
	.cd-legend {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.3rem;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
	.cd-code-word {
		font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
		font-size: 0.85em;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
</style>
